Description: Redact admin_pass from cloud-init query on OpenStack ConfigDrive
 Redact plain-text root password for non-root users for OpenStack instances
 launched with --use-config-drive and --admin-pass "mypass".

 In cases where an OpenStack VM is launched with both config drive and an
 admin-pass, the command cloud-init query potentially exposed that
 admin_pass value to non-root users. Close this exposure by correctly
 declaring admin_pass as a sensitive metadata key.

